<title>USA: Mining Services Q1 net rises.</title>
<headline>Mining Services Q1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>SALT LAKE CITY 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>MINING SERVICES INTERNATIONAL CORP</p>
<p>						   Three Months Ended</p>
<p>						 3/31/97	    3/31/96</p>
<p> Revenue				  $6,745,000	 $5,851,000</p>
<p> Income before taxes		   1,678,000	    984,000</p>
<p> Provision for income taxes	    549,000	    296,000</p>
<p> Net income				1,128,000	    688,000</p>
<p> Net EPS					  0.15		0.12*</p>
<p> Wgtd avg shrs outstanding	   7,666,271	  5,654,045</p>
<p>*NOTE:  Based on average common and common equivalent shares outstanding as of 3/31/97, net EPS for the period ended March 31, 1996 would be $0.09.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
</text>
